OL,3,GNEWSAFive men jailed over #1.4m
OL,4,Acannabis factory in West Lothian
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been jailed for running a
OL,7,F#1.4m cannabis factory in West Lothian.
OL,9,FHung Nguyen, 31, Ho Cuong, 24, Nguyen
OL,10,FPhong, 22, Wei Nguyen, 28, and Bui Nam,
OL,11,F38 were caught following an increase in
OL,12,Felectricity usage at a former clothing
OL,13,Ffactory in West Calder.
OL,15,FPolice discovered 850 plants inside the
OL,16,Fpremises at Polbeth Industrial Estate.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
