OL,3,GNEWSAFive men jailed over #1.4m
OL,4,Acannabis factory in West Lothian
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll five Asian men - who were living in
OL,7,Fthe UK illegally - pleaded guilty to
OL,8,Fproducing the Class B drug at the
OL,9,Findustrial unit between 11 July and 25
OL,10,FSeptember 2024. They were jailed for a
OL,11,Ftotal of 17 years and three months.
